Note: EPL Math Package — Usage Examples
Use "epl-math"

Note: --- Number Theory ---
Print "Primes up to 50:"
Print sieve_of_eratosthenes(50)

Print "Prime factors of 360:"
Print prime_factors(360)

Print "10th prime number:"
Print nth_prime(10)

Print "Divisors of 28:"
Print divisors(28)

Print "Is 28 perfect?"
Print is_perfect(28)

Print "Euler totient of 12:"
Print euler_totient(12)

Print "2^10 mod 1000:"
Print modular_pow(2, 10, 1000)

Note: --- Combinatorics ---
Print "P(5,3):"
Print permutations_count(5, 3)

Print "C(10,3):"
Print combinations_count(10, 3)

Print "5th Catalan number:"
Print catalan_number(5)

Print "Pascal row 5:"
Print pascal_row(5)

Note: --- Statistics ---
Create data equal to [4, 8, 15, 16, 23, 42]
Print "Variance:"
Print variance(data)

Print "Standard deviation:"
Print std_dev(data)

Print "75th percentile:"
Print percentile(data, 75)

Print "Quartiles:"
Print quartiles(data)

Note: --- Sequences ---
Print "First 10 Fibonacci:"
Print fibonacci_sequence(10)

Print "Arithmetic 2,5,8...:"
Print arithmetic_sequence(2, 3, 6)

Print "Geometric 1,2,4...:"
Print geometric_sequence(1, 2, 6)
